lign="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><bold>Serum cholesterol categories (mmol&#x02009;l<sup>&#x02212;1</sup>)</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>No. of cases</bold></th><th align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>Hazard ratio</bold></th><th align="center" valign="top" char="." charoff="50"><bold>95&#x00025; Confidence interval</bold></th></tr></thead><tbody valign="top"><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003c;5.7<sup>a</sup></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">3</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.0</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x02014;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">5.7&#x02013;6.9</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">7</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.3</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.3&#x02013;5.1</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02a7e;7.0</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">11</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4.5</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">1.3&#x02013;16.2</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote1"><label>a</label><p>Reference category.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote2"><label/><p><italic>P</italic>-value for the trend=0.005.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>